---

The visual design tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css` and the icon set in `src/lib/icons.ts` are
transcribed from the "Aizen desktop interface design" project authored for this product.

The Aizen symbol in `src/lib/Mark.svelte` and `scripts/make-source-icon.ps1` is redrawn as
geometry from the supplied `aizen-logo-symbol-transparent.gif`. The source file itself is not
redistributed here: it is solid white, so it would be invisible on the light theme, and at
825 kB it is many times the size of the entire application bundle.
